# Member 2-task handoff discipline

Applies to all roles in this repo: `dev-be`, `dev-fe`, `dev-mobile`, `devops`, `qa`, `qc`, `ba-process`, `ba-data`, `sa`, `technical-manager`, `pm`.

## Mandatory handoff payload (every completed task)

Do not end with a short confirmation only. Every completion must include:

- `completion_report`: what was closed, what is still open.
- `next_owner`: who should act next.
- `next_dispatch_prompt`: concrete prompt PM can send immediately.
- `ack_status`: `READY_FOR_QA` or `PASS_TO_PM` (or explicit FAIL/BLOCKED status).
- `evidence_path`: reproducible file path.

## 2-task rule (session/day)

When a member completes 2 tasks in the same session/day:

- The second completion **must** include an actionable `next_dispatch_prompt`.
- PM must dispatch next owner in the same session (no defer-only wording).

## PM enforcement

PM treats missing `next_dispatch_prompt` as invalid handoff and re-requests completion payload before closing the wave.
